 "text": "Hey, good to hear from you. How are you? Once upon time, in a big forest, there lived a brave little girl named Lulu. One night, Lulu heard a strange noise coming from the wood shed. She went to investigate and saw a big shadow looming over her. Lulu tried to scare it away with some ye olde ghost busting tricks, but the shadow just smiled and came closer. Lulu felt scared, but she remembered her grandpa's old adage, never turn your back on a shadow. Sure. Once upon a time, two witches lived together. One was kind and gentle, the other mean and gruff.",
